          <mxGeometry height="20" width="450" x="11.5" y="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-43" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=5;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;瓶颈一：底层性能边界&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(授权频段 Aloha/SDT 类)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#d79b00;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• 基于按包独立竞争框架&lt;br&gt;• 碰撞累积，接入传激增&lt;br&gt;• 局部修补未突破吞吐上限&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="225" x="11.5" y="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-44" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=5;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;瓶颈二：高负载效率错配&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(非授权频段 CSMA/LBT 类)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#d79b00;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• 基于长包传输前提设计&lt;br&gt;• 高并发下盲目侦听开销激增&lt;br&gt;• 信道利用率与公平性骤降&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="225" x="262.5" y="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-45" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=5;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;瓶颈三：多机制协同受限&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(传统静态配置与 AI 演进)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#d79b00;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• 静态参数难适动态演化负载&lt;br&gt;• NWDAF 基于大尺度数据&lt;br&gt;• 缺乏快速低开销智能模型&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="210" x="521.5" y="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-46" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="747" x="1.5" y="338" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-47" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;本文提炼的研究问题与联合优化方案&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="400" x="11.5" y="343" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-48" edge="1" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" source="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-43" style="labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=default;" target="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-49">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-49" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=5;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;方案一：增强 Aloha 机制&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(授权频谱碰撞化解)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#82b366;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• 兼容 3GPP 标准与低复杂度&lt;br&gt;• 解决按包重复竞争碰撞问题&lt;br&gt;• 提升有效吞吐并降低信令开销&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="97" width="220" x="14" y="373" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-50" edge="1" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" source="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-44" style="labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=default;" target="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-51">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-51" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=5;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;方案二：改良 LBT 机制&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(非授权频谱高负载提升)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#82b366;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• 保持机制原生分布式特性&lt;br&gt;• 削减高负载下侦听开销&lt;br&gt;• 保证系统内短时公平性&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="97" width="225" x="262.5" y="373" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-52" edge="1" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" source="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-45" style="labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=default;" target="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-53">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-53" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=5;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;方案三：智能协议协同&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(多业务动态自适应优化)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#82b366;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• 打破静态单一参数配置法则&lt;br&gt;• 构建基站侧低开销智能模型&lt;br&gt;• 实现快速协议/参数联调决策&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="97" width="225" x="514" y="373" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-54" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;研究愿景：构建高效稳定且低开销的 B5G/6G 复杂物联网接入理论与技术体系&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="750" y="511" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-81" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=6;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;感知类终端 (mMTC/RedCap)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#9673a6;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;实体&lt;/b&gt;：智能表计、环境传感节点&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;特征&lt;/b&gt;：单包数据小、终端能耗受限&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;形态&lt;/b&gt;：海量并发、随机突发性上报&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="230" x="9" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-82" parent="mJGa0G7FCUklgAyDEIZf-91" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;paddingTop=6;paddingLeft=8;paddingRight=8;fontFamily=Times New Roman, SimSun;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;控制类终端 (URLLC/IIoT)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color:#9673a6;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;实体&lt;/b&gt;：工业 AGV、协同机械臂&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;特征&lt;/b&gt;：严苛的确定性与高可靠要求&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;形态&lt;/b&gt;：极低时延驱动、信令开销大&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="210" x="521.5" y="49" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
